Test data
---------

`tests/fixtures/lingam/` holds causal orders, coefficient matrices and
cumulants produced by the original FedLiNGAM implementation
(https://github.com/ptorrijos99/FedLiNGAM) on three synthetic problems, for the
test suite only; it is not part of the wheel. The networks the examples use
ship with causalbase.
